WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.320
Want to study, work or live in Croatia?

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.040
Radar Croacia puts official programmes,

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:11.660
scholarships and opportunities on one map, in Spanish.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.720
Pick your situation and see what fits,

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:16.060
with its source and review date.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.860
Got questions? Ask the Radar:

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:23.290
it answers only from verified entries, in your language.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.680
It's on WhatsApp too, in Spanish, Croatian,

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.580
English or Portuguese.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:33.940
And if you need a person,

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:37.140
type PERSON and someone from the team will reply.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:48.680
Every day, an agent checks twelve official sources and proposes changes.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:51.320
A person approves them before they're published.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.680
Free and open source.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:57.560
radar.zustrolabs.com

